                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Is Halloween big in India?</h3>
                                        <p>Growing urban adoption — Delhi + Mumbai + Bangalore + Hyderabad urban millennial + Gen-Z. Party + costume-driven. Not traditional cultural event but real commercial segment.</p>
                                        <h3>How much does Halloween drive for USA D2C?</h3>
                                        <p>15-30% of Q4 for costume + décor + candy brands. Fashion + beauty + party categories peak higher.</p>
                                        <h3>Should India brands do Halloween campaigns?</h3>
                                        <p>For urban Gen-Z / millennial focused brands: yes. Growing segment. Cultural sensitivity + Indian Halloween adaptation matters.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest Halloween mistake?</h3>
                                        <p>Missing pre-Halloween planning window. Consumers plan costumes + decor 4-6 weeks ahead + early-shoppers convert best.</p>
